{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Ratiba+ 是一款專為繁忙家庭設計的行程與家務整理工具，將預約、青少年活動、家庭活動、家務、膳食及購物清單集中在同一個 iCloud 共享空間，並可同步至不同 Apple 裝置。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合需要協調全家日程的家庭使用。</p>\n\n<h2>全家行程與家務管理</h2>\n<p>Ratiba+ 能同時檢視行事曆與家務清單，找出成員重疊預約或過度繁忙的情況。你可為醫生、牙醫、治療及學校活動建立預約，加入準備清單與歷史紀錄；家務可輪流分配、設定積分、期限與提醒；膳食計劃與共用購物清單亦會即時同步到每位家庭成員的裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1004-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1005-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1006-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1007-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1008-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Ratiba+: Family Organizer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T13:39:45.738583+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}